==== Flash Layout ====
The XGS1250-12 has a 16 MiB Macronix MX25L12833F NOR flash chip. The realtek target uses a dynamic kernel/rootfs split, so actual sizes of the ''kernel'', ''rootfs'' and ''rootfs_data'' partitions may vary.

^   XGS1250-12  Flash Layout (OpenWrt)     ^^^^^^^^^^
^ Layer0  |  raw NOR flash memory chip ([[wp>Serial Peripheral Interface Bus|spi]]0.0: mx25l12805d) 16384 KiB  |||||||||
^ Layer1  |  mtd0 **//u-boot//** 896 KiB  |  mtd1 **//u-boot-env//** 64 KiB  |  mtd2 **//u-boot-env2//** 64 KiB  |  mtd3 **//jffs//** 1024 KiB  |  mtd4 **//jffs2//** 1024 KiB  |  mtd5  **//runtime//** 13184 KiB  |||  mtd9 **//log//** 128 KiB |
